<title>SWEDEN: Handelsbanken could bid for bank.</title>
<headline>Handelsbanken could bid for bank.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish commercial bank Svenska Handelsbanken said on Tuesday it did not exclude bidding for mortgage institution and bank Stadshypotek.</p>
<p>Handelsbanken chairman Arne Martensson told a news conference &quot;I cannot exclude that we might be in the bidding for Stadshypotek.&quot;</p>
<p>The Swedish state has a 34 percent stake in Stadshypotek which it has said it may sell.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1017</p>
